diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5772552..679f5b3 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -11,6 +11,11 @@ python3 -m tasklite stats
 python3 -m tasklite.api          # API on http://127.0.0.1:8080
 ```
 
+Due dates: `add "pay rent" --due 2026-11-01` and `list --overdue` (open tasks past due).
+An invalid date prints an error and exits with code 2. The API accepts `"due"` on
+`POST /tasks` (400 `{"error": ...}` if invalid), returns `due` in task JSON, and supports
+`GET /tasks?overdue=1`. Older `tasks.json` files without `due` still load.
+
 Tasks are stored in `tasks.json` in the current directory (override with `TASKLITE_FILE`).
 
 Tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t .`
